body+=section('The challenge','Most people meet your church<br>online before they walk in.',rows([('A brand that no longer fits','The identity was right for the church you were, not the church you are becoming.'),('A website visitors can’t use','Service times, directions and next steps are hard to find on a phone.'),('A message that stops on Sunday','Sermons and stories don’t travel through the week to the people who need them.'),('Media your team struggles to run','Cameras, sound and streaming that depend on one volunteer who knows how it works.')]))
