body+='<div class="wrap">'+callout('Leading the church,<br>not only its brand?','Senior pastors and ministry leaders can also request consideration for the ABN Private Leadership Network. Founding invitations are planned for February 2027, with 50 founding seats. Consideration requests are followed by a private 20-minute call.','network/','Explore the Network')+'</div>'
