body=intro('About Ascend Brand Network','Supporting the leader.<br>Strengthening the work.','Ascend Brand Network brings together two priorities: trusted relationships for the people who lead, and clear communication for the organisations they serve.','creative.jpg')
body+=section('Our story','Two needs.<br>One organisation.','<p class="large-copy">Meaningful leadership requires more than individual ability.</p><p class="body-copy">It benefits from trusted relationships, shared learning, responsible stewardship and the right resources. Ascend Brand Network brings these priorities together through distinct but complementary initiatives: the Network supports the people leading, and the Studio supports the organisations and work they are building.</p>','story')
body+=section('Mission & vision','A commitment to people.',rows([('Mission','To support the people who lead and strengthen the organisations they serve.'),('Vision','Where faith leads, we build.')]),'mission')
body+='<section class="about-collaboration wrap" aria-labelledby="collaboration-title"><figure><div class="collaboration-frame"><img src="@assets/about-studio-team.png" alt="A small digital design team discussing website sketches and working together around a studio table" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><figcaption class="collaboration-caption"><div><p class="eyebrow">People. Perspective. Possibility.</p><h2 id="collaboration-title">Good work starts<br>with people.</h2></div><p>Illustrative studio setting</p></figcaption></figure></section>'
body+=section('Core values','We believe how you build matters.',rows(VALUES),'values')
body+=section('Leadership & our team','The people behind ABN.','<div class="team-grid">'+''.join(f'<article><span class="team-initials">{initials}</span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{role}</p></article>' for initials,name,role in TEAM)+'</div>','team')
body+=section('The ABN ecosystem','One network.<br>Distinct ways to serve.',rows([('Ascend Studio',link('services/','Brand, digital, web, production and church media services')),('The Network',link('network/','ABN Private Leadership Network')),('The Shepherd’s Roundtable',link('roundtable/','The Network’s quarterly, invitation-only gathering')),('ABN Experience',link('experiences/','Leadership dinners, retreats and curated gatherings')),('The Shepherd’s Diary',link('resources/#diary','Conversations behind the calling. Coming soon.'))]),'ecosystem')
add('about','About Ascend Brand Network',body)

body=network_nav()+intro('The ABN Private Leadership Network','Leadership is<br>better together.','A private peer network for senior pastors and ministry leaders, built around trusted relationships, meaningful conversations and curated leadership experiences.','conversation.jpg','network-intro')
body+='<div class="wrap network-facts"><div><strong>50</strong><span>Founding seats</span></div><div><strong>Feb ’27</strong><span>Invitations planned</span></div><div><strong>Jun ’27</strong><span>First roundtable planned</span></div><div><strong>US</strong><span>Nationwide</span></div></div>'
body+=section('The community','A trusted room for<br>the people who lead.','<p class="large-copy">Independent and non-denominational. A peer community built around the person carrying the responsibility.</p>'+contact_link('network','Request membership consideration'),'overview')
body+=section('Why the Network exists','Ministry has changed.<br>The infrastructure hasn’t kept up.','<p class="body-copy">The demands on senior pastors have grown: organisational complexity, public scrutiny, the pressure of digital ministry, and the emotional weight of shepherding congregations through cultural turbulence.</p><p class="body-copy">Most peer structures built for ministry leaders were designed for a different era: conferences with thousands of attendees, denominations that prioritise alignment over honesty, coaching programs that treat every leader the same.</p><p class="large-copy">The ABN Network is being built as the other kind of room, where the people across the table carry the same weight and aren’t trying to sell you something, impress you or protect their position.</p>','why')
body+=section('Member experience','What the Network<br>is being built to offer.','<p class="section-note">Planned elements of membership. Final terms are confirmed with each formal invitation.</p>'+rows([('The Shepherd’s Roundtable','A private, invitation-only gathering that meets quarterly, with 8–12 leaders in each session. The first is planned for June 2027. '+link('roundtable/','About the Roundtable')),('Leadership Dinners & Retreats','Curated dinners for 8–12 leaders in select cities, beginning with a planned Atlanta dinner, and an inaugural leadership retreat planned for Q3 2027. '+link('experiences/','See Experiences')),('Connection Between Gatherings','Relationships that continue beyond individual events.'),('Ascend Studio for Members','Access to ABN’s creative studio for brand, web, media and events.')]),'experience')
body+=section('Community values','The structure<br>behind the trust.',rows([('No celebrities. No headliners.','No featured speakers at an ABN gathering. No one is brought in to impress the room.'),('Confidentiality is structural.','Nothing posted from inside the room, no one quoted without consent, and no marketing made from what members share.'),('Intentionally small. Always.','Gatherings are sized for real conversation, not to maximise reach. Small is the feature, not the constraint.'),('Built to compound, not to consume.','The value builds over time, with each gathering, each peer relationship and each honest conversation.')]),'values')
body+=section('Founding membership','The first 50 leaders<br>set the standard.','<p class="large-copy">The founding cohort is not a waitlist. It is the first room, and the relationships formed in it will shape the character of ABN for years to come.</p><p class="body-copy">Formal invitations are planned to begin in February 2027. Expressions of interest are welcome. Participation is subject to review and formal invitation.</p>'+contact_link('network','Express interest'),'founding')
body+=section('Who can join','Built for leaders<br>who are already leading.',rows([('Senior Pastors','Carrying organisational and spiritual leadership at the same time.'),('Founding Pastors','Building something from scratch while also sustaining it.'),('Executive Pastors & Ministry Directors','Leading at an organisational level in complex, mission-driven environments.'),('Ministry Leaders','Carrying significant regional, denominational or parachurch responsibility.')])+'<div class="plain-note"><h3>Not a fit right now</h3><p>The Network is not designed for emerging leaders, early-career associate pastors, or anyone looking for a structured curriculum. The room’s value depends on everyone in it leading at a similar level.</p></div>','who')
body+=section('Membership process','Four steps.<br>No automated responses.','<p class="body-copy">Every submission is reviewed personally. We respond within 48 hours.</p>'+rows([('Submit a consideration request','Share who you are, your role and what you’re navigating.'),('A private 20-minute call','Not an interview: a real exchange about whether this is the right room for this season.'),('A clear answer','Yes or not yet, and why. No automated declines, no form letters.'),('Formal invitation','Founding invitations are planned to begin in February 2027.')]),'process')
body+=section('Membership FAQs','Common questions.',faq('network-faq'),'faqs')
add('network','The ABN Private Leadership Network',body)

body=network_nav()+intro('The Network’s signature experience','The Shepherd’s<br>Roundtable.','A different room. A deeper conversation. A private, invitation-only gathering for senior pastors and ministry leaders, being developed for honest dialogue that doesn’t happen in public.','conversation.jpg')
body+=section('Why the Roundtable exists','No speakers. No sponsors.<br>No audience.','<p class="large-copy">Just leaders who have earned their seats, and the discipline to leave titles at the door.</p>')
body+=section('Rules of the room','The structure that earns the trust.',rows([('No speakers. No experts.','Everyone in the room is a peer. No one presents, and every voice carries equal weight.'),('No public agenda.','What’s discussed stays in the room: no social media, no attributed quotes, no marketing made from what is shared.'),('Curated, not open.','Every seat is considered. The value depends on the calibre and compatibility of who sits at the table.'),('Titles stay at the door.','Inside, you are a leader in a room of leaders: a peer doing the same hard work.')]),'rules')
body+=section('The format','Four deliberate phases.',rows([('Opening context','A brief framing: a question or theme surfaced from the group ahead of time, to anchor the conversation without controlling it.'),('Open-table conversation','The core of the Roundtable. Leaders talk to each other, not to a facilitator.'),('Closing commitments','Each leader names one decision, question or shift they’re taking with them.'),('Follow-through','Connection continues between gatherings.')]),'format')
body+=section('The inaugural gathering','June 2027.<br>The first room.','<p class="large-copy">The first Shepherd’s Roundtable is planned for June 2027 with the founding cohort of the ABN Network.</p><p class="body-copy">Quarterly sessions, four times a year, with 8–12 leaders. Founding invitations are planned to begin in February 2027. Location is shared with invited leaders. Participation is subject to review and formal invitation.</p>'+contact_link('network','Request consideration'),'inaugural')
add('roundtable','The Shepherd’s Roundtable',body)
body=network_nav()+intro('ABN Experiences','Rooms built for<br>honest leadership.','Curated, invitation-only gatherings for senior pastors and ministry leaders. Small rooms, no stage, nothing performed.','dinner.jpg')
